...
pci0: <PCI bus> on pcib0
sym0: <810> port 0x1fffc00-0x1fffcff mem 0x7fdde00-0x7fddeff irq 4 at device 1.0 on pci0
sym0: No NVRAM, ID 7, Fast-10, SE, parity checking
