From freebsd-alpha  Sun May 21 01:03:00 2000
From: Andrew Gallatin <gallatin () cs ! duke ! edu>
Date: Sun, 21 May 2000 01:03:00 +0000
To: freebsd-alpha
Subject: Re: Trouble with dc driver and DE500-BA card
